msgid "A final vowel is no guarantee: <0>tuba</0> ends in one too, and its stem is <1>toa</1>. The dictionary pair settles it: <2>kodu, kodu</2> but <3>tuba, toa</3>."
msgstr "A final vowel is no guarantee: <0>tuba</0> ends in one too, and its stem is <1>toa</1>. The dictionary pair settles it: <2>kodu, kodu</2> but <3>tuba, toa</3>."

